# Synthesizer Labship, station 9+: "Flying, vigilance" and the 4/4 box (CR 721.2b). Bot1 charges it with Lodestone Golem (5) and Dauntless Scrapbot (3) on turn 3 and Memnite (1) on turn 5: at 8 counters it is no creature; the ninth makes it a 4/4 artifact creature with flying and vigilance, which attacks and stays untapped. The 2+ ability still works there, so at the beginning of combat Dauntless Scrapbot, already a 3/3 Robot creature, becomes a 2/2 flying one and stays a Robot (the ruling: it overwrites the base power and toughness), and the Labship itself is not a legal "other" artifact (CR 115.1), nor are two artifacts one answer ("up to one").

